# Programming 2 — COP 3014

A collection of assignments from the Programming 2 course at Florida Atlantic University.
Projects focus on building a stronger foundation in C++ through object-oriented design
and classic computer science algorithms.

## Topics Covered
- Object-Oriented Programming (classes, inheritance, polymorphism)
- Recursion
- Sorting algorithms (bubble, merge, quick sort, etc.)
- Searching algorithms (binary search, linear search)

## Languages
- C++
